                                                    <div class="value-statement__block">
                                <h2 style="color: #510c76;">Register for Classes</h2>
<p><strong>Spring registration is open. C</strong><strong>lasses begin Jan. 11, 2027.</strong></p>
<p>To register, log into your MyEAC account, select the desired courses from the provided list, and follow the prompts to complete your registration.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a class="button" style="margin: 0px 12px 8px 12px;" href="https://my.eac.edu/CMCPortal/secure/student/loginstu.aspx">REGISTER NOW</a><a class="button purple-dark reverse" style="margin: 0px 12px 8px 12px;" href="http://eac.edu/courses/">SEARCH COURSES</a><a class="link" style="margin: 0px 12px 8px 12px; border: none;" href="https://eac.edu/admissions/">ADMISSIONS</a></p>
                            </div>
