        <section class="two-up-inset-carousel reveal-up load-hidden">
        <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-inner">
                                        <section class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide">
                    <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide-inner">
                        <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-left">
                                                            <h3><span style="color: #ffffff;">An <span style="color: #fea400;">Affordable Education</span> with Great Return on Investment</span></h3>
<p>Graduate debt-free with Eastern Arizona College&#8217;s tuition that averages just one-fourth the cost of an Arizona university. Plus, you can benefit from over 100 on-campus job opportunities.</p>
<p><a class="button" href="https://eac.edu/costs-aid/">LEARN ABOUT COST AND AID</a></p>
                                                    </div>
                        <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-right">
                                                            <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-right__image frame-image">
                                    <img src="https://eac.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/quality_education.webp" alt="High Quality Education"/>
                                </div>
                                                    </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
                                        <section class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide">
                    <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide-inner">
                        <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-left">
                                                            <h3><span style="color: #ffffff;">A Vibrant Residential <span style="color: #fea400;">College Experience</span></span></h3>
<p>Think you&#8217;ll be heading home after class? Think again! EA students get involved in clubs, activities, intramurals, our celebrated performing arts programs, cheering on the Fighting Gila Monsters, and joining friends in outdoor adventures surrounding campus. Live in the residence halls and don&#8217;t miss a moment of the fun!</p>
<p><a class="button" href="https://eac.edu/student-life/">LEARN MORE ABOUT STUDENT LIFE</a></p>
                                                    </div>
                        <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-right">
                                                            <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-right__image frame-image">
                                    <img src="https://eac.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/residence_hall.webp" alt="Residence Hall"/>
                                </div>
                                                    </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
                                        <section class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide">
                    <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide-inner">
                        <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-left">
                                                            <h3><span style="color: #ffffff;"><span style="color: #fea400;">A High Quality Education</span> with Lots of Support</span></h3>
<p>At Eastern Arizona College, we offer top-tier education and unwavering support. Our expert faculty, small class sizes, and comprehensive services ensure your success. From tutoring to career development, we&#8217;re dedicated to bringing you up to speed and helping you thrive.</p>
<p><a class="button" href="https://eac.edu/student-life/student-support/">LEARN MORE ABOUT ACADEMIC SUPPORT</a></p>
                                                    </div>
                        <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-right">
                                                            <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-slide__section-right__image frame-image">
                                    <img src="https://eac.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/support-1-e1747697247951.webp" alt="Support"/>
                                </div>
                                                    </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
                    </div>
                    <div class="two-up-inset-carousel-arrows">
                <button class="two-up-inset-carousel-arrow-prev">
