            <section class="two-up-text-image" style="background-color: ">
            <div class='grid-x grid-padding-x'>
                <div class='small-12 large-6 cell'>
                                            <div class="two-up-text-image__block">
                            <h3>Affordable Bachelor Degree Offerings</h3>
<p>Enroll today for Eastern Arizona College&#8217;s <span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ffffff;"><a style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://eac.edu/bachelors/music-education/">Bachelor of Music Education</a>, </span><a href="https://eac.edu/bachelors/leadership/"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;">Bachelor&#8217;s</span><span style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;"> in Organizational Leadership,</span></span></a> and <span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ffffff;"><a style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://eac.edu/bachelors/health/">Bachelor of Health Sciences</a></span> degrees or apply to the <span style="text-decoration: underline; color: #ffffff;"><a style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://eac.edu/bachelors/nursing/">Registered Nurse to Bachelor of Science in Nursing program</a></span>. A <a href="https://eac.edu/bachelors/secondary-education/"><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;">Bachelor &#8216;s in Secondary Education</span></span></a> and in <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;"><a style="color: #ffffff; text-decoration: underline;" href="https://eac.edu/bachelors/bachelor-of-arts-in-elementary-education/">Elementary Education</a></span> </span>are also coming to EA Fall 2027.</p>
<p><a class="button" href="https://eac.edu/bachelors/">YOUR BACHELOR DEGREE JOURNEY AWAITS</a></p>
                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class='small-12 large-6 two-up-text-image__image cell' style="background-image: url(https://eac.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/allied-health-2-scaled.jpeg); background-size: cover;">
                        <img class="invisible" src="https://eac.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/allied-health-2-scaled.jpeg" alt="AlliedHealth2"/>
                    </div>
                            </div>
        </section>
    
